<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell Intl downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell Intl downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said on Tuesday it cut its rating on Rockwell International Corp to a buy from a strong buy, because of weakness in the semiconductor business.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jeffrey Sprague said he lowered his 1997 earnings estimate to $2.90 per share from $3.00 and his 1998 estimate to $3.40 per share from $3.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Rockwell shares were down 1-1/4 at 59-1/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
